---

---

<!-- Direct from Stitch about.html -->
<section id="o-nas" class="relative overflow-hidden" data-animate="section">
  <div class="pt-24 pb-24 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto relative">
    <!-- Decorative bg -->
    <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-primary-container/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-48 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-secondary-container/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] -z-10"></div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-20 text-center md:text-left max-w-3xl">
      <span class="uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary font-semibold mb-4 block text-sm" data-animate="section-subtitle">Nasza Filozofia</span>
      <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-headline text-on-surface font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Dlaczego Harmonia?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body" data-animate="section-subtitle">
        Wierzymy, że droga do dobrostanu zaczyna się w miejscu, które daje poczucie bezpieczeństwa i akceptacji. Nasze podejście łączy empatię z najwyższymi standardami klinicznymi.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Value cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-24" data-animate="cards">
      <div class="group bg-surface-container-low p-10 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 ease-out relative overflow-hidden" data-animate="card">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-5 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[6rem]">spa</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary-container/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-primary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[2rem]">spa</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-headline font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Zaufanie</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Bezpieczna przestrzeń terapeutyczna oparta na empatii i wzajemnym szacunku. Budujemy fundamenty trwałej relacji z pacjentem.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group bg-surface-container p-10 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 ease-out relative overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant/10" data-animate="card">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-5 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[6rem]">verified</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-secondary-container/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-secondary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[2rem]">verified</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-headline font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Profesjonalizm</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Nasz zespół to wykwalifikowani specjaliści z wieloletnim doświadczeniem, którzy stale podnoszą swoje kompetencje.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group bg-surface-container-low p-10 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 ease-out relative overflow-hidden" data-animate="card">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-5 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[6rem]">shield</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary-container/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-primary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[2rem]">shield</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-headline font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Bezpieczeństwo</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Komfortowe gabinety zaprojektowane z myślą o Twoim spokoju i prywatności. Dbamy o każdy detal Twojego otoczenia.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mission statement -->
    <div class="relative bg-surface-container-highest rounded-xl p-12 md:p-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 overflow-hidden" data-animate="fade-up">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-primary/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
        <img alt="Spokojne wnętrze gabinetu terapeutycznego" class="w-full h-80 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-lg" src="/images/about.webp" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="w-full md:w-2/3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="h-[1px] w-12 bg-secondary"></div>
          <span class="font-headline italic text-secondary text-xl font-medium">Nasza Misja</span>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-headline text-on-surface leading-snug font-medium mb-8">
          "W Harmonii wierzymy, że <span class="text-primary italic">każdy głos ma znaczenie</span>. Naszą misją jest wspieranie zdrowia psychicznego i rozwoju mowy w atmosferze pełnej zrozumienia i profesjonalnej opieki."
        </blockquote>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-primary border border-primary/10">Indywidualne podejście</span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-primary border border-primary/10">Nowoczesne metody</span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-primary border border-primary/10">Pełna dyskrecja</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
